<i>Whoo‐hoo</i>

45
00:05:06.403 --> 00:05:08.366
<i>Yeah</i>

46
00:05:09.702 --> 00:05:12.249
<i>Whoo‐hoo</i>

47
00:05:12.457 --> 00:05:13.961
<i>Yeah</i>

48
00:05:14.044 --> 00:05:15.673
<i>Hey!</i>

49
00:05:16.382 --> 00:05:19.556
<i>Whoo‐hoo</i>

50
00:05:19.722 --> 00:05:22.728
<i>Yeah, hey</i>

51
00:05:22.895 --> 00:05:25.776
<i>Whoo‐hoo</i>

52
00:05:25.943 --> 00:05:29.366
<i>Yeah, hey</i>

53
00:05:29.449 --> 00:05:32.874
<i>Whoo‐hoo</i>

54
00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.251
<i>Yeah</i>

55
00:05:34.376 --> 00:05:36.172
<i>Hey!</i>

56
00:05:36.338 --> 00:05:38.677
<i>Whoo‐hoo</i>

57
00:05:38.844 --> 00:05:40.848
<i>Yeah</i>

58
00:05:41.015 --> 00:05:42.852
<i>Hey!</i>

59
00:05:43.019 --> 00:05:45.858
<i>Whoo‐hoo</i>

60
00:05:46.025 --> 00:05:48.196
<i>Yeah...</i>

61
00:05:54.959 --> 00:05:57.840
NARRATOR:
<i>Yeah, my life is pretty cool.</i>

62
00:05:58.007 --> 00:06:00.053
<i>But this story
isn't just about me.</i>

63
00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:02.600
<i>It's about
some of the most amazing,</i>

64
00:06:02.767 --> 00:06:04.854
<i>real‐life superheroes</i>

65
00:06:05.689 --> 00:06:07.317
<i>and what it takes
to become one.</i>

66
00:06:10.532 --> 00:06:12.035
(SNIFFING)

67
00:06:12.118 --> 00:06:14.039
‐(RESCUERS CHATTING)
‐(DOGS WHINING)

68
00:06:14.122 --> 00:06:16.670
<i>It's also a love story
between you and us.</i>

69
00:06:17.964 --> 00:06:20.009
<i>And if that isn't enough,</i>

70
00:06:20.176 --> 00:06:21.930
<i>the hero of this movie...</i>

71
00:06:22.097 --> 00:06:23.266
<i>is a puppy.</i>

72
00:06:24.519 --> 00:06:25.813
(GROANING)

73
00:06:27.107 --> 00:06:29.111
<i>Yeah, she's cute.</i>

74
00:06:31.992 --> 00:06:33.327
<i>She's the one on the end</i>

75
00:06:33.411 --> 00:06:34.914
<i>without a collar.</i>

76
00:06:35.081 --> 00:06:38.296
<i>The runt... in a litter
of ten Dutch Shepherds.</i>

77
00:06:38.588 --> 00:06:40.300
(PUPPY FUSSING)

78
00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:42.470
(GRUNTING)

79
00:06:44.016 --> 00:06:45.561
(WHINING)

80
00:06:45.728 --> 00:06:47.397
<i>She doesn't have a name yet,</i>

81
00:06:47.565 --> 00:06:48.984
<i>but this little dog...</i>

82
00:06:49.151 --> 00:06:50.278
<i>has a big destiny.</i>

83
00:06:50.445 --> 00:06:51.573
(PUPPY CRIES)

84
00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:53.284
(GRUNTS)

85
00:06:53.409 --> 00:06:56.206
<i>(WE'RE GONNA BE FRIENDS</i>
BY THE WHITE STRIPES PLAYING)

86
00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:58.377
NARRATOR: <i>Enter
the human hero of this story.</i>

87
00:06:59.046 --> 00:07:00.883
<i>Her name is Cat.</i>

88
00:07:01.843 --> 00:07:03.012
<i>I'm serious.</i>

89
00:07:03.179 --> 00:07:04.473
<i>That's her real name.</i>

90
00:07:04.557 --> 00:07:06.101
<i>You can't make this stuff up.</i>

91
00:07:06.226 --> 00:07:07.980
<i>Climb the fence
books and pens...</i>

92
00:07:08.147 --> 00:07:09.567
<i>Cat's a fire captain from Miami</i>

93
00:07:09.734 --> 00:07:11.738
<i>who saves lives in disasters.</i>

94
00:07:12.155 --> 00:07:13.784
<i>She's come all the way
to Michigan</i>

95
00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.581
<i>in a blizzard to find
a new partner.</i>

96
00:07:17.373 --> 00:07:18.668
<i>A small partner.</i>

97
00:07:18.752 --> 00:07:20.254
‐(PUPPIES SNUFFLING)
‐(WHINING)

98
00:07:20.672 --> 00:07:22.718
CAT: <i>I'm going
to look at three puppies.</i>

99
00:07:22.802 --> 00:07:23.845
(WHISTLING, KISSING)

100
00:07:23.929 --> 00:07:25.599
<i>Three female
Dutch Shepherd puppies.</i>

101
00:07:25.766 --> 00:07:27.435
That's a good girl,
you're so pretty.

102
00:07:27.603 --> 00:07:30.108
<i>I'm looking for a puppy
that wants to play with a toy</i>

103
00:07:30.191 --> 00:07:31.611
<i>no matter what
I do in the room.</i>

104
00:07:31.694 --> 00:07:32.780
(VOCALIZING)

105
00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:36.621
<i>Loud noises,
different obstacles.</i>

106
00:07:36.788 --> 00:07:39.919
<i>That kind of focus, that's what
I need for Search and Rescue.</i>

107
00:07:40.086 --> 00:07:41.965
<i>We don't notice
any time passed...</i>

108
00:07:42.132 --> 00:07:45.514
CAT: Where you at? What you got?
What you got, huh?

109
00:07:45.597 --> 00:07:47.142
Female dogs.
I like female dogs.

110
00:07:47.852 --> 00:07:50.481
<i>I don't know, I mean, it's just
something that I prefer.</i>

111
00:07:50.649 --> 00:07:51.943
Boys pee on everything.

112
00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:53.697
(LAUGHS) They do.

113
00:07:53.864 --> 00:07:55.701
(YAPPING, GROWLING)

114
00:07:55.868 --> 00:07:57.705
(LAUGHTER)

115
00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.249
WOMAN:
Speak into the camera.

116
00:07:59.416 --> 00:08:00.586
(DOG YAPPING)

117
00:08:00.669 --> 00:08:03.048
CAT: <i>I want it to just be
a gut, overall...</i>

118
00:08:03.299 --> 00:08:05.721
feeling that this is,
this is her.

119
00:08:05.804 --> 00:08:07.390
This is the dog for me.

120
00:08:07.558 --> 00:08:10.564
<i>I can tell that
we are gonna be friends</i>

121
00:08:10.731 --> 00:08:12.776
CAT: Good girl.

122
00:08:13.402 --> 00:08:14.697
What do you think?

123
00:08:14.864 --> 00:08:16.450
(DOG PANTS, YIPS)

124
00:08:17.202 --> 00:08:18.580
You think?

125
00:08:19.624 --> 00:08:21.043
CAT: I have a name for her.

126
00:08:23.005 --> 00:08:24.090
Halo.

127
00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:29.644
MAN: So, let me go grab
the paperwork.

128
00:08:29.727 --> 00:08:30.646
Yeah, okay.

129
00:08:30.729 --> 00:08:32.190
(HALO GRUNTING)

130
00:08:32.357 --> 00:08:35.112
Hi, you want
to come home with me?

131
00:08:36.532 --> 00:08:37.910
Here, here.

132
00:08:57.992 --> 00:08:59.704
NARRATOR:
<i>Welcome to Miami.</i>

133
00:08:59.787 --> 00:09:01.123
<i>Halo's new home.</i>

134
00:09:01.206 --> 00:09:03.210
<i>And the headquarters
of one of the greatest</i>

135
00:09:03.294 --> 00:09:05.131
<i>rescue teams on Earth.</i>

136
00:09:06.008 --> 00:09:07.803
<i>Florida Task Force‐1.</i>

137
00:09:13.105 --> 00:09:15.109
<i>When the call for help
comes in,</i>

138
00:09:15.276 --> 00:09:17.447
<i>these guys leap into action.</i>

139
00:09:17.615 --> 00:09:20.286
(INDISTINCT CHATTER OVER RADIO)

140
00:09:25.756 --> 00:09:28.720
NARRATOR:
<i>And at the center of it all...</i>

141
00:09:28.887 --> 00:09:30.641
<i>the K‐9 unit.</i>

142
00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:50.471
<i>But here's the big question,</i>

143
00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.603
<i>does Halo have what it takes
to join them?</i>

144
00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:54.980
Over.

145
00:09:55.147 --> 00:09:56.400
Hop up.

146
00:09:56.567 --> 00:09:58.320
CAT: <i>Step one...
pick a puppy.</i>

147
00:09:58.905 --> 00:10:00.074
<i>Bring her home with me,</i>

148
00:10:00.241 --> 00:10:01.994
<i>let her get used to me
and my family.</i>

149
00:10:02.161 --> 00:10:04.499
Here? Here? Good girl...

150
00:10:04.625 --> 00:10:06.671
CAT: <i>Take her wherever I can.</i>

151
00:10:06.838 --> 00:10:08.550
<i>To work with me
at the fire station.</i>

152
00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.929
<i>Continue to play with her.</i>

153
00:10:11.096 --> 00:10:13.852
<i>Have everybody else
play with her.</i>

154
00:10:14.018 --> 00:10:17.233
<i>And most of all, just give her
time to be a puppy.</i>

155
00:10:24.999 --> 00:10:26.586
CAT: No, no, no.

156
00:10:27.086 --> 00:10:28.673
(LAUGHTER)

157
00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:31.637
(HALO YAPPING)

158
00:10:32.681 --> 00:10:34.643
No... here. Halo, here.

159
00:10:45.791 --> 00:10:47.418
(KISSES)
This way.

160
00:10:49.422 --> 00:10:51.176
Halo.
(VOCALIZES)

161
00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:55.936
Come on.
(KISSES)

162
00:10:56.102 --> 00:10:57.731
Good girl.

163
00:10:57.898 --> 00:10:59.234
Come on.

164
00:11:00.444 --> 00:11:02.114
‐Oh, hey, Cat.
‐CAT: Hey, guys.

165
00:11:02.198 --> 00:11:03.576
Good doggy. Hi, good doggy.

166
00:11:05.496 --> 00:11:07.500
(BARKING)

167
00:11:11.926 --> 00:11:14.138
MAN:
That's a good boy.

168
00:11:14.305 --> 00:11:15.767
NARRATOR:
<i>This is where the dogs</i>

169
00:11:15.934 --> 00:11:17.563
<i>of Florida Task Force 1</i>

170
00:11:17.646 --> 00:11:19.440
<i>learn to find someone buried</i>

171
00:11:19.608 --> 00:11:21.612
<i>after a hurricane or a tornado.</i>

172
00:11:33.135 --> 00:11:35.139
(CLAMORING)

173
00:11:37.435 --> 00:11:39.063
CAT: <i>You never
want it to happen.</i>

174
00:11:39.147 --> 00:11:41.151
<i>You never want there
to be that incident</i>

175
00:11:41.234 --> 00:11:43.030
<i>where you're needed that badly.</i>

176
00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:45.535
(BARKING)

177
00:11:47.956 --> 00:11:49.167
<i>But the dogs,</i>

178
00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.797
<i>they are truly amazing.</i>

179
00:11:53.175 --> 00:11:54.469
MAN: Oh, yeah.

180
00:11:55.597 --> 00:11:57.475
CAT: <i>That's why
we train so hard...</i>

181
00:11:59.521 --> 00:12:01.692
<i>...for that one
possible moment.</i>

182
00:12:05.157 --> 00:12:07.036
(BARKING)

183
00:12:17.683 --> 00:12:19.687
(PANTING)

184
00:12:24.697 --> 00:12:26.909
<i>(L'APPUNTAMENTO</i>
BY ORNELLA VANONI PLAYING)

185
00:12:48.828 --> 00:12:51.332
NARRATOR: <i>The story of how
us dogs and you humans</i>

186
00:12:51.416 --> 00:12:53.211
<i>started saving lives together</i>

187
00:12:53.295 --> 00:12:55.382
<i>goes back hundreds of years.</i>

188
00:12:56.468 --> 00:12:58.890
<i>Some think it began at sea.</i>

189
00:13:06.572 --> 00:13:07.991
<i>This is Reef.</i>

190
00:13:08.116 --> 00:13:10.496
<i>She's a descendant of some
of the very first dogs</i>

191
00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:11.832
<i>to save lives.</i>

192
00:13:11.916 --> 00:13:14.295
(BARKING)

193
00:13:14.588 --> 00:13:16.550
<i>With her partner Ferruccio,</i>

194
00:13:16.884 --> 00:13:18.888
<i>she patrols the coast of Italy.</i>

195
00:13:22.103 --> 00:13:23.856
(FERRUCCIO SPEAKING ITALIAN)

196
00:13:24.357 --> 00:13:27.446
FERRUCCIO: <i>Reef is great.
She's an incredible dog.</i>

197
00:13:27.531 --> 00:13:30.494
<i>She comes from a long line
of water rescue dogs.</i>

198
00:13:31.454 --> 00:13:33.626
<i>In fact, her grandfather, Mas,</i>

199
00:13:33.709 --> 00:13:36.214
<i>saved my daughter
from drowning.</i>

200
00:13:36.297 --> 00:13:38.678
<i>Ever since then,
I've devoted my life</i>

201
00:13:38.761 --> 00:13:40.890
<i>to working with Newfoundlands.</i>

202
00:13:46.944 --> 00:13:48.280
NARRATOR:
<i>Reef's ancestors</i>

203
00:13:48.363 --> 00:13:50.158
<i>helped fishermen for centuries,</i>

204
00:13:50.242 --> 00:13:53.290
<i>hauling nets and carrying
messages from boat to boat.</i>

205
00:13:56.547 --> 00:14:00.053
<i>But no one had any idea
how amazing they really were</i>

206
00:14:00.262 --> 00:14:03.476
<i>until one of you humans
fell overboard.</i>

207
00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.274
(SHOUTING IN ITALIAN)

208
00:14:10.032 --> 00:14:12.077
NARRATOR:
<i>And in that moment,</i>

209
00:14:12.161 --> 00:14:14.958
<i>the superpower dog was born.</i>

210
00:14:15.167 --> 00:14:16.962
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

211
00:14:17.129 --> 00:14:19.551
<i>(THE ECSTASY OF GOLD</i>
BY ENNIO MORRICONE PLAYING)

212
00:14:37.419 --> 00:14:39.591
NARRATOR:
<i>Reef is the ultimate lifeguard.</i>

213
00:14:40.217 --> 00:14:41.887
<i>She has two coats,</i>

214
00:14:42.054 --> 00:14:44.601
<i>a shaggy outer coat
that keeps her dry</i>

215
00:14:44.768 --> 00:14:47.524
<i>and a soft inner one
that keeps her warm.</i>

216
00:14:49.987 --> 00:14:53.076
<i>Underneath, she's pure muscle,</i>

217
00:14:53.243 --> 00:14:55.455
<i>with a thick tail
that helps her steer.</i>

218
00:14:58.838 --> 00:15:00.340
<i>Forget the doggy paddle.</i>

219
00:15:01.009 --> 00:15:02.679
<i>With massive webbed paws,</i>

220
00:15:02.762 --> 00:15:05.142
<i>she can tow
up to 50 times her weight</i>

221
00:15:05.225 --> 00:15:07.021
<i>and swim for miles.</i>

222
00:15:09.108 --> 00:15:11.112
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

223
00:15:28.564 --> 00:15:31.277
NARRATOR: <i>Today is just
a training exercise,</i>

224
00:15:31.402 --> 00:15:33.741
<i>but Reef and Ferruccio
have saved many lives.</i>

225
00:15:33.949 --> 00:15:35.828
(BARKS)

226
00:15:36.079 --> 00:15:39.335
<i>And they're inspiring
a new generation of heroes.</i>

227
00:15:42.007 --> 00:15:43.803
<i>You're looking
at the latest recruits</i>

228
00:15:43.886 --> 00:15:46.683
<i>of the Italian School
of Water Rescue Dogs.</i>

229
00:15:47.309 --> 00:15:49.355
<i>And class is in session.</i>

230
00:16:23.464 --> 00:16:25.468
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

231
00:16:37.702 --> 00:16:40.165
NARRATOR: <i>The graduates
of this school will go on</i>

232
00:16:40.248 --> 00:16:42.127
<i>to guard Italy's lakes
and beaches,</i>

233
00:16:43.505 --> 00:16:45.635
<i>and this pup just can't wait.</i>

234
00:16:50.603 --> 00:16:53.358
(BARKING)

235
00:16:56.072 --> 00:16:58.076
(PANTING)

236
00:17:00.873 --> 00:17:02.877
NARRATOR:
<i>Halo is now four months older</i>

237
00:17:02.961 --> 00:17:05.298
<i>and already doubled in size.</i>

238
